{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Of The Lilies\u00a0</strong>is a visual novel-style romantic adventure game about love, loss, and sacrifice.\u00a0Explore a fantasy colonial world together with your love interest in 5 different routes, and reach 15 different endings by deciding if your own motives over the greater good is worth a single sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you'll play through the <strong>first part of the prologue</strong>. Uncover your backstory, explore your hometown, and meet two of five love interests who will shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/aa2a026710ac3453744bda839f087ed6.avif?t=1758062491\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/e87851a5e4290769ca4a4bd01a476450.avif?t=1758062491\" width=1280 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As the chieftain-to-be in the small village of Tayabac, your family was counting on you to lead the tribe and take care of your people. But when your hometown is invaded by the Seiyslan\u00a0Empire, you\u2019re left without a home, without a culture, and without a family.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You were saved by Lady Sabina, who brought you into her home, with the condition that you join an organization that keeps the Seiyslan people safe. You'll have the chance to meet 5 love interests along the way:\u00a0<strong>Seiji</strong>\u2014your protective\u00a0best friend, <strong>Myo</strong>\u2014the charming rebel leader,\u00a0<strong>Taji</strong>\u2014your mysterious rival, <strong>Laisa</strong>\u2014a cunning pirate, and <strong>Lien</strong>\u2014the conqueror who separated you from your family.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>10 years later, when the curses that come only once a century resurface,\u00a0you are tasked to protect the Seiyslan Empire, the very people that took everything away from you, and are\u00a0faced with a choice that forces you to decide on the path you\u2019re willing to take to come to terms with your past. <strong>Who are you willing to sacrifice?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/364b5bad6daa00b27fc97e218700744c.avif?t=1758062491\" width=1280 height=116 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet 2 of 5 Romanceable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of The Lilies features 5 love interests, each with their own views and personal stories. In this demo, you will be introduced to <strong>Seiji</strong>, <i>the childhood friend</i>, and <strong>Lien</strong>, <i>the conqueror</i>. Begin forming bonds that may last or falter in the face of conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/f23801996d35e7fb001756e470157763.poster.avif?t=1758062491\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/f23801996d35e7fb001756e470157763.webm?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/f23801996d35e7fb001756e470157763.mp4?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/906c28c2c4e6db31d26e3145a6985f37.poster.avif?t=1758062491\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/906c28c2c4e6db31d26e3145a6985f37.webm?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/906c28c2c4e6db31d26e3145a6985f37.mp4?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/6a70e4f760c8ab473a9e95d7d22cfbd9.poster.avif?t=1758062491\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/6a70e4f760c8ab473a9e95d7d22cfbd9.webm?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/6a70e4f760c8ab473a9e95d7d22cfbd9.mp4?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/c2cad04185399b7ca5cb552512902e9b.poster.avif?t=1758062491\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/c2cad04185399b7ca5cb552512902e9b.webm?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/c2cad04185399b7ca5cb552512902e9b.mp4?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/06bafab969c72e7721d280ac0a7d7131.poster.avif?t=1758062491\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/06bafab969c72e7721d280ac0a7d7131.webm?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/06bafab969c72e7721d280ac0a7d7131.mp4?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Branching Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make branching decisions that affect your experience, from unlocking unique CGs to different gameplay paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/6e42e9a3451a7677b038591cc0c793c7.poster.avif?t=1758062491\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/6e42e9a3451a7677b038591cc0c793c7.webm?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/6e42e9a3451a7677b038591cc0c793c7.mp4?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World of Ambana</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a fantasy world inspired by Southeast Asian culture and history. Step into your hometown, Tayabac, and discover the early details of the world you live in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/26c5c5fe20c19f701c8286a5eae685aa.poster.avif?t=1758062491\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/26c5c5fe20c19f701c8286a5eae685aa.webm?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/26c5c5fe20c19f701c8286a5eae685aa.mp4?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat enemies through mini games woven into your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/e91ea90b2390c85cbaaea242d790265b.poster.avif?t=1758062491\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/e91ea90b2390c85cbaaea242d790265b.webm?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/e91ea90b2390c85cbaaea242d790265b.mp4?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>9 CGs and Original Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the prologue with 9 beautifully illustrated CGs and an original soundtrack meant to capture key moments in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/30d042ebbd2dd84d8108f88f0e6d5f1e.poster.avif?t=1758062491\" width=977 height=129 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/30d042ebbd2dd84d8108f88f0e6d5f1e.webm?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background