7677b038591cc0c793c7.mp4?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World of Ambana</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a fantasy world inspired by Southeast Asian culture and history. Step into your hometown, Tayabac, and discover the early details of the world you live in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/26c5c5fe20c19f701c8286a5eae685aa.poster.avif?t=1758062491\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/26c5c5fe20c19f701c8286a5eae685aa.webm?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/26c5c5fe20c19f701c8286a5eae685aa.mp4?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat enemies through mini games woven into your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/e91ea90b2390c85cbaaea242d790265b.poster.avif?t=1758062491\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/e91ea90b2390c85cbaaea242d790265b.webm?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/e91ea90b2390c85cbaaea242d790265b.mp4?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>9 CGs and Original Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the prologue with 9 beautifully illustrated CGs and an original soundtrack meant to capture key moments in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/30d042ebbd2dd84d8108f88f0e6d5f1e.poster.avif?t=1758062491\" width=977 height=129 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/extras/30d042ebbd2dd84d8108f88f0e6d5f1e.webm?t=1758062491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Startris Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3348900","name":"Of The Lilies"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020450/f0599c77d2b86c9de2c9f57cf8a299da1a91436b/header.jpg?t=1758062491","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Of The Lilies Demo: Part I","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3-6100 Processor or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1920x108